---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/global/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | CalcQuick.online"
  description="CalcQuick terms of use. Read our full terms including advertising, medical disclaimers, and usage guidelines for our free online calculators."
  canonical="/terms"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">
    <div class="container-site prose" style="padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px; max-width: 760px;">
      <div class="prose-header fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 12px; display: block;">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-display-lg" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 8px;">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 48px;">Last updated: June 2025 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Please read carefully before using this site.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-intro fade-up">
        <p>By accessing and using CalcQuick.online (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or use the site.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By using CalcQuick, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Your continued use of the site constitutes your acceptance of any changes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>2. Use License and Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>CalcQuick grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use the Site for personal, educational, and informational purposes only. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the site for any commercial data scraping, automated querying, or bulk data extraction</li>
          <li>Reverse-engineer, copy, or republish our calculator logic without attribution</li>
          <li>Engage in any activity that degrades the performance or availability of the site for other users</li>
          <li>Attempt to circumvent any security measures or access restricted areas of the site</li>
          <li>Use the site in any manner that violates applicable local, state, national, or international laws</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>3. Medical and Health Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="disclaimer-box">
          <strong>Important:</strong> The health calculators on CalcQuick (including the BMI Calculator, Calorie Calculator, and Age Calculator) are provided for <strong>informational and educational purposes only</strong>. They are not intended to constitute, and should not be construed as, professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
        </div>
        <p>Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider before making any dietary or health-related decisions. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay in seeking it because of something you have read on or calculated using this site.</p>
        <p>BMI values, calorie estimates, and age-based health data are statistical models and may not accurately reflect the health status of any individual. Consult a qualified healthcare professional for personalized health assessments.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>4. Financial Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The Tip Calculator and any other financial tools on CalcQuick are provided for convenient estimation purposes only. They do not constitute financial, tax, or legal advice. Information about tipping customs and tax rules is general in nature and may vary by location, jurisdiction, and circumstance. Always consult a qualified financial or tax professional for advice specific to your situation.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
        <p>CalcQuick participates in the Google AdSense advertising program. Google and its partners may display advertisements on our site based on your browsing history and other factors. These advertisements are clearly distinct from editorial content.</p>
        <p>We do not endorse, represent, or warrant the accuracy of information contained in any advertisements displayed on this site. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any advertiser or linked site.</p>
        <p>You can manage your advertising preferences at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>6. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our site may contain links to third-party websites or services. These links are provided for your convenience and do not constitute an endorsement of those sites or their content. We have no control over the content, privacy policies, or practices of third-party sites and accept no responsibility for them. We encourage you to review the privacy policy of any site you visit.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>The calculators and all content on CalcQuick are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis, without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement</li>
          <li>Warranties that the site will be error-free, continuously available, or free of viruses</li>
          <li>Warranties regarding the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any information</li>
        </ul>
        <p>While we strive for accuracy in all our calculator formulas using clinically-validated and industry-standard methods, individual results may vary. CalcQuick does not guarantee that any calculation result will match your individual circumstance.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, CalcQuick and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your use of, or inability to use, the site or any calculator tool</li>
          <li>Any health, financial, or other decisions made based on calculator results</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized access to or alteration of your data</li>
          <li>Any errors, interruptions, defects, delays, or failures in the site's operation</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on CalcQuick — including but not limited to text, graphics, code, and calculator logic — is the property of CalcQuick and is protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works without express written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Use shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from these terms or your use of the site shall be resolved in the appropriate courts of competent jurisdiction.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="fade-up">
        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Use, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>. We are committed to resolving any concerns in a fair and timely manner.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .prose-intro {
    background: var(--color-canvas-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-link);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .prose-intro p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-body); line-height: 26px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .prose-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .disclaimer-box {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 10%, var(--color-canvas));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  section { margin-bottom: 48px; }
  section h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); letter-spacing: -0.4px; }
  section p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-body); line-height: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  section ul { padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  section li { font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-body); line-height: 24px; }
  section a { color: var(--color-link); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
